[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

; The giant Canary Island date palm (PRP-PLANT-067), as the game places it.
; Editor-owned.
;
; The model is `assets/props/date_palm.glb`, sent from
; `assets/source/props/date_palm.blend` (built by `tools/blender/date_palm.py`)
; with the Keep Your Ticket panel. Forty fronds spray from low on a scarred
; trunk, about 13 m tall and 14.5 m across. Its collision is derived on export,
; on layer 1 and covers the trunk to about 6.5 m. The trunk stands on the origin
; and the crown's spread is centred 0.56 m off it, as the fronds fall. Place the
; scene by where the trunk should stand. Not placed anywhere yet; where it stands
; is Christina's.

